    "detailed_description": "Gang District is a local multiplayer shooter party game with a share screen mechanism.  Pick up a weapon and start blasting and kick some tail!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGang District supports the Steam Remote Play feature. But it is built to play locally.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt has 28+ weapons and 12 maps at this stage. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeapons are randomly spawning at specific locations with a percentage chance for each weapon to spawn. While maps are selectable at any time of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are currently 6 mini boss weapons. If you are lucky enough, you might have them and win the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGang District is developed by a sole developer.",
